{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1377670-player-comes-to-me-with-this-technocrat-ex-hermetic-defector-from-greylocke-chantry","id":1377670,"title":"player comes to me with this - TECHNOCRAT ex hermetic defector from Greylocke chantry","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-03-31T23:53:41-07:00","id":1377670,"title":"player comes to me with this - TECHNOCRAT ex hermetic defector from Greylocke chantry","content":"so he wants to play a technocrat, who is probably syndicate or maybe Void Engineer. im obviously pushing for the latter, because how the fuck do you explain to your boss that you were a fucking hermetic. <br /> <br /> I mean, how does the syndicate even recruit ex trad mages? the VEs will do so, especially if he defected and surrendered.<br /> <br /> his inspiration for that scene, is that he gave the NWO or some other Convention the info on greylocke and then defected to the VE's, in the style of Khan Noonien Singh in the new Star Trek movie Into Darkness.<br /> <br /> Khan saves their ass after some Klingons come and try to kill Kirk and his team, and helps Kirk kill there Klingons before beating him up and issuing his surrender to a incapacitated star fleet team. <br /> <br /> I don't know if I can work with this, but throw me any ideas you have for a player who wants to do this for my next game and an ST who wants to cope... lol","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3148-zennis","name":"Zennis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-01T00:05:41-07:00","id":1377673,"title":"","content":"If he's a former Hermetic but now a Technocrat, he no longer practices Hermeticism. You've got Technocratic Conditioning to ensure this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-01T01:03:26-07:00","id":1377681,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1377670-player-comes-to-me-with-this-technocrat-ex-hermetic-defector-from-greylocke-chantry?p=1377673#post1377673\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If he's a former Hermetic but now a Technocrat, he no longer practices Hermeticism. You've got Technocratic Conditioning to ensure this.</div> </div> </div> </div>ok fair enough. <br /> <br /> that's a good point. <br /> <br /> does the syndicate really recruit ex trad mages for all but the lamest jobs?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3148-zennis","name":"Zennis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-01T01:04:24-07:00","id":1377682,"title":"","content":"I mean they strike me as so cynical and untrusting... it feels like anyone who's weird (by their standards) gets put on the sidelines.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3148-zennis","name":"Zennis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-01T01:28:26-07:00","id":1377685,"title":"","content":"it seems a little high profile to be honest. but hey maybe high profile makes for a good back story.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3148-zennis","name":"Zennis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-01T03:29:31-07:00","id":1377700,"title":"","content":"There's an NWO procedure involving Entropy 5 and Mind 5 that, after some time, all but ensures that you've retrained their paradigm. The NWO tends to be the one that prefers recruiting Tradies than other Conventions, but the Syndicate are also known for sometimes headhunting from other Conventions too. Perhaps that how he could join the Syndicate?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26024-distant-choir","name":"Distant Choir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26024_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-01T08:52:16-07:00","id":1377742,"title":"","content":"If he has an inclination toward the Syndicate mindset, he could end up with them. Syndics are bargainers; they're willing to work with anyone if it advances their interests. For instance, there's a sample character in the Revised Syndicate book who has a team of Traditionists on call. <br /> <br /> If your former Hermetic has a similar mindset, an existing Syndic might take notice of him and recruit him.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachment